body:
The following policy should enforce a check once/hour max. Auth is checked with each request of `tailscale ssh root@....`.

```json
{
  "acls": [
    {
      "action": "accept",
      "src": [
        "*"
      ],
      "dst": [
        "*:*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ssh": [
    {
      "action": "check",
      "src": [
        "alice@"
      ],
      "dst": [
        "autogroup:self"
      ],
      "users": [
        "root",
        "autogroup:nonroot"
      ],
      "checkPeriod": "1h"
    }
  ]
}
```

